{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11202390","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11202390","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1120239001:1":{"text":"やっぱりお前には勝てないな……","source_cn":"我果然还是赢不了你……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x00D6436EDF300008","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1120239002:1":{"text":"諦めろ、オレはお前とは一緒に行かない。","source_cn":"放弃吧，我不会和你回去的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BF57664C80007B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1120239003:1":{"text":"諦めない。","source_cn":"我不会放弃。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC560ECDC3E0F62CE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"諦めない。","female":"諦めない。","variant_male_record_index":"118464","variant_female_record_index":"118465","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120239004:1":{"text":"俺はお前に勝てないが、父上がようやく手に入れた族長の地位を他の奴に奪わせることは、絶対にない。","source_cn":"虽然我打不过你，但我绝不会把父亲好不容易的得到的族长之...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD74ED80C47388EFB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1120239005:1":{"text":"お前が族長になりたくないなら仕方ない。俺が自分の力でクルーガーに勝って、ブラックロアー族を導いていく。","source_cn":"你不愿意继承族长，无所谓。我会凭借自己的力量赢过克鲁格...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93D9933A129AB3A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":""